- name: note_3
  id: note
  parameters:
    alias: ''
    comment: "This will create a bandpass filter\nby frequency shifting a lowpass\n\
      filter. \n1) Calculate the number of filter\ntaps.\n2) Calculate the bandwidth\
      \ of\nthe filter. Use half the bandwidth\nas the lowpass filter cutoff\nfrequency.\n\
      3) Create sinc curve for the\nlowpass filter.\n4) Window the lowpass filter.\n\
      5) Frequency shift the lowpass\nfilter by the center of the desired\nbandpass\
      \ filter passband.\n6) Normalize the gain of the\nfilter to create the final\
      \ BPF."
    note: Creating a BPF
  states:
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
    bus_structure: null
    coordinate: [272, 280.0]
    rotation: 0
    state: enabled
